bject. Cites E3.1, E1.5, S53 row 706, Galway 2004, Hiary 2011 (state_of_art_2026.md §2.5b). Cross-domain ingredient: classical asymmetric setup-cost comparison between dense eigensolvers (O(K³)) and Hiary's specialised zero-locating algorithm (O(t^{4/13}) per zero) — mildly novel framing; S53 had not compared to the Hiary baseline. See experiments/analytic/connes_amortisation/. | 193 |
